Ilo
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 82 DEAL RUKEQ
RUKEQ 10 FACE_LAST
RUKEQ 7 FACE_LAST
RUKEQ 4 FACE_LAST
RUKEQ 1 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE RUKEQ RUKEQ
AND
    OR
        DESTSRC Suit alternate_color
        SRC Suit {SPADES, DIAMONDS}
    OR
        DESTSRC Rank equal
        DEST Size < 5
$win
OR
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL RUKEQ Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
